      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A wheel-shaped Dy(iii) single-molecule magnet (SMM), supported by polyoxotungstates, Cs15K8Na12[K⊂{(AsW9O33)Dy(H2O)2}6]·71H2O (1), is described here. The polyanion of 1 possesses an idealized S6 symmetry. The effective energy barrier (68 K) obtained from magnetic studies is consistent with the deconvolution of the luminescence spectra of 1."},
